  "sourceConclusions": [
    "Only the dot directory may differ from historical metadata, and only by exact equality to the already recorded R6 raw after tuple. Historical raw/normalized root tuples and the entire original root roster remain authenticated.",
    "All 1740 file bytes/blob hashes/metadata, 112 nonroot directory metadata, sole dependency link, full dependency inventory and traversal races remain checked. Two complete source/dependency proofs must equal. The root-substituted historical digest and separate nonroot digest are checked without writing or restoring any private metadata.",
    "Prerequisite consumers use genuine completed disposable outcome/summary/consumer shapes, including actualTool.exit_code and stdoutSummary. The current-AM full preflight consumer binds real source/config/scope roles, full inventory, actual terminal tool and scoped ownership plus local-only machine evidence classification.",
    "Future protection/source/dependency proofs remain null at launch, so the grant binds only preexisting roles. Final current-root diagnostic adoption and fresh complete protected postflight remain later observed requirements.",
    "Required source-review aliases match the actual LAUNCH.py consumer and include the exact LAUNCH.py physical role. Original alarm/registration/reap/group-clear/result behavior remains under the qualified original 300/320/330 route and 8 MiB streams."
  ],
